  "title": "Connecticut Cheeseburger Dip",
  "description": "This creamy, mouth-watering appetizer is flavored with McCormick® Brown Gravy Mix and loaded with ground beef, ketchup, mustard, onions, Cheddar, tomatoes, and pickles.",
